OL,3,GNEWSAA-level student and family feared
OL,4,Adead in Nepal
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn A-level student and his family are
OL,7,Ffeared dead after devastating flash
OL,8,Ffloods in Nepal.
OL,10,FSpandan Sahu, from Surrey, was in Nepal
OL,11,Fwith his father Santosh Sahu, mother
OL,12,FSurabhi Manmath Padhy, and 13-year-old
OL,13,Fsister.
OL,15,FThe 18-year-old had just finished his
OL,16,FA-levels at Royal Grammar School,
OL,17,FGuildford, and was preparing to study
OL,18,Fphilosophy, politics and economics at
OL,19,Funiversity, according to his LinkedIn
OL,20,Fpage.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
